  "context": "## Car Evolution Mobility OS – Product Annex\nThis annex defines the current Car Evolution Mobility Operating System as a product architecture.\n\nCar Evolution is not presented here as a consumer app, a dashboard or a research concept. It is a mobility orchestration layer for cities, campuses, resorts, airports, industrial parks, mobility operators and regions that need to coordinate transport capacity they already have.\n\nCar Evolution provides that layer: it converts demand, available capacity, policy constraints, scenario weights and live execution feedback into coordinated operating decisions.\nTags: Agents and distributed coordination 11.11%; Authority, permissions and delegation 5.56%; Decisions and responsibility 13.89%; Research and technical documentation 19.44%; Memory, community and territory 5.56%; Mobility and infrastructure 44.44%\nCard: https://dakleyer.github.io/perspective-beyond/sources/car-evolution-mobility-os-product-annex-e1954/\nSource document: https://jubap.eu/mobility/product/\n\n",
